{
  "description": "When the node starts draining, every connection receives Reconnect with the same upper bound delayMs = min(10000, drain grace), picks its own random delay in [0, delayMs] and is then closed with 1001. delayMs is normally present; it is omitted from the expectation because the bound depends on the host's drain grace (and proto3 JSON drops it when the grace is 0).",
